Note on third-party data:

This repository's source code is licensed under the terms above.  However,
the underlying datasets in data/raw/ are redistributed from their original
publishers — the U.S. Census Bureau (via IPUMS), Congressional Budget Office,
Internal Revenue Service Statistics of Income Division, Office of Management
and Budget, Bureau of Economic Analysis, Bureau of Labor Statistics, Social
Security Administration, USDA Food and Nutrition Service, U.S. Department of
Health and Human Services / CMS, USAC, the Tax Policy Center / Census State
& Local Government Finance, and Giving USA.  Each retains its own license,
attribution, and redistribution policy.  IPUMS in particular requires user
registration and an end-user agreement; the cps_00015.csv extract included
in this repository was obtained under a personal IPUMS account and is
redistributed solely for replication of the analyses in this repository
(see https://cps.ipums.org/cps/citation.shtml for required citation).

The MIT License above applies only to the source code, scripts, and derived
panel CSVs in output/ — not to the upstream data files in data/raw/.
